# Tools ci/scripts/install-tools.py downloads into ci/bin, which
# also holds checked-in shims (envsubst, gcloud, gsutil, modprobe, sudo,
# udevadm). Named individually rather than ignoring the directory so a new shim
# is still tracked by default; a bootstrap that runs locally otherwise dirties
# the tree and these land in a commit.
